WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.232
"Class, we're going to get a class pet," said Mrs. Frink.

2
00:00:11.233 --> 00:00:15.868
"We need to decide what kind of pet."

3
00:00:15.869 --> 00:00:17.708
Eric raised his hand.

4
00:00:17.709 --> 00:00:21.687
"I want a dog!"

5
00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:24.692
"No way!" said Pearl.

6
00:00:24.693 --> 00:00:29.194
"Dogs chew everything!"

7
00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:34.135
"A dog is not a good class pet," said Mrs. Frink.

8
00:00:34.136 --> 00:00:38.819
"Dogs need too much care."

9
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:43.945
"I like hamsters," said Alice.

10
00:00:43.946 --> 00:00:47.944
"Let's get a giraffe!" said Owen.

11
00:00:47.945 --> 00:00:52.934
Everybody laughed.

12
00:00:52.935 --> 00:00:58.008
Mrs. Frink frowned. "Please be serious, Owen."

13
00:00:58.009 --> 00:01:03.555
More kids shouted ideas.

14
00:01:03.556 --> 00:01:06.494
The classroom was very noisy.

15
00:01:06.495 --> 00:01:09.622
Mrs. Frink held up a hand.

16
00:01:09.623 --> 00:01:12.742
"Let's take a poll," she said.

17
00:01:12.743 --> 00:01:24.217
"We'll each vote for the pet we want."

18
00:01:24.218 --> 00:01:48.502
The teacher passed out pieces of paper for voting.

19
00:01:48.503 --> 00:01:57.046
When everyone was done, Mrs. Frink collected the papers.

20
00:01:57.047 --> 00:02:00.303
"Now we'll count the votes," she said.

21
00:02:00.304 --> 00:02:03.784
"We'll make a bar graph.

22
00:02:03.785 --> 00:02:12.802
Then we'll see which pet got the most votes."

23
00:02:12.803 --> 00:02:17.353
Mrs. Frink drew a graph on the whiteboard.

24
00:02:17.354 --> 00:02:31.524
"Let's write numbers along the left side of the graph," said Mrs. Frink.

25
00:02:31.525 --> 00:02:41.972
"And let's write pets at the bottom of the graph."

26
00:02:41.973 --> 00:02:44.884
Mrs. Frink read the first vote.

27
00:02:44.885 --> 00:02:52.237
"One vote for hamster."

28
00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:59.313
Alice wrote "hamster" at the bottom of the graph.

29
00:02:59.314 --> 00:03:04.132
She colored up to the 1.

30
00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:12.304
Then Mrs. Frink read another vote.

31
00:03:12.305 --> 00:03:31.117
Alice added that to the graph.

32
00:03:31.118 --> 00:03:35.232
Soon the bar graph was almost full.

33
00:03:35.233 --> 00:03:44.155
"Boo!" said Alice. "Hamster got just one vote!"

34
00:03:44.156 --> 00:03:49.291
"Giraffe got two votes!" Owen laughed.

35
00:03:49.292 --> 00:03:54.004
"I see four votes for fish," said Pearl.

36
00:03:54.005 --> 00:03:56.893
"That's what I voted for!"

37
00:03:56.894 --> 00:04:01.182
"Hedgehog got four votes too," said Eric.

38
00:04:01.183 --> 00:04:03.748
"It's a tie!"

39
00:04:03.749 --> 00:04:12.105
"No, there's one more vote," said Mrs. Frink.

40
00:04:12.106 --> 00:04:19.982
She colored one of the bars on the graph.

41
00:04:19.983 --> 00:04:25.258
"So, what pet will we get?"

42
00:04:25.259 --> 00:04:33.552
"A hedgehog!" The class cheered.

